# UI refresh runs include extensionless reports as well as captures.
# Keep the written summary; generated evidence stays available locally.
.verification/ui-refresh-*/**
!.verification/ui-refresh-complete/validation.md

# Room presentation: keep the reproducible harness and final text evidence only.
# Screenshots, interim reports and future rerun directories remain local.
.verification/room-viewport/*
!.verification/room-viewport/validation.md
!.verification/room-viewport/PresentationCheck/
.verification/room-viewport/PresentationCheck/*
!.verification/room-viewport/PresentationCheck/Program.cs
